seq v=1 rig=screen program=claude build=2.1.0
# T1: an approve accepted 600 ms before the box went is past STEP_ACT_MS:
# it did not dismiss the box, so the close leans to nobody, `passed`, and
# names the orphaned act (`act=approve`, no `by=`).
see busy
half
see prompt edit
expect open p1 approval par=t1 box=edit @500
admit harness act=approve
accept
pass 600
see busy
expect close p1 approval out=passed by=- act=approve @1100
